        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800TVH, Modern Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern in design, the Tavaris Handleset has a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Single Cylinder of this Kwikset made 800TVH Door Entry Set is operated by key from the outside and a thumbturn from the inside. The Modern Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset is solid brass construction and comes backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/tavaris-dummy-handleset-kwikset-802tvh\"><b>Tavaris Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Contemporary Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 800TVH Tavaris Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-19/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Bottom Thru-Bolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800TVH",
                "description": "Modern in design, the Tavaris Handleset has a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Single Cylinder of this Kwikset made 800TVH Door Entry Set is operated by key from the outside and a thumbturn from the inside. The Modern Tavaris Single Cylinder Handleset is solid brass construction and comes backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
                "keywords": "KWI-800TVH, 800TVH single cylinder Tavaris handle sets, Tavaris handlesets, kwikset signature series, kwikset, handlesets, keyed handlesets, front door locks, deadbolt locksets, key locksets, single cylinder handlesets, 800TVH single cylinder handle sets, Kwikset 800 TVH handlesets, modern handlesets, contemporary handlesets,"
